# Sourcing data.
#
# Real manufacturers' salespeople, with their personal mobile numbers. This
# repository is public and git keeps every version, so a file committed once is
# public for ever — deleting it later does not help. The shape is documented in
# sourcing/README.md and the data belongs in Postgres.
sourcing/*
!sourcing/README.md
!sourcing/example.json
